sequenceDiagram
  actor Ops as Operator / SRE
  participant Prim as Primary SQL
  participant Fog as Failover group listener
  participant Sec as Secondary SQL
  participant Api as Container Apps Api
  participant Wk as Container Apps Worker

  Note over Ops,Sec: Drill - DATABASE_FAILOVER runbook
  Ops->>Fog: Confirm listener health
  Ops->>Sec: Force failover drill
  Fog-->>Api: Connection string listener FQDN
  Fog-->>Wk: Same listener
  Api->>Sec: New primary after cutover
  Wk->>Sec: Resume outbox drain
  Ops->>Api: Smoke health ready plus synthetic review
  Ops->>Ops: Record actual RTO vs target
